    metrics: [
      { label: "Toe Box Width", value: 90 },
      { label: "All-Day Comfort", value: 86 },
      { label: "Weight", value: 88 },
      { label: "Value for Money", value: 91 },
      { label: "Buyer Protection", value: 80 },
    ],
    trustNote: "Amazon returns policy applies",
    price: "Check price",
    image: "/images/gf-whitin-w81.webp",
    url: AMZ("B0D1JSSXJX", "whitin81"),
    ctaLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    pros: [
      "Zero drop sole and a wide fit, in a sneaker shape that does not look orthopaedic",
      "Machine washable",
      "WHITIN is the established name in budget barefoot shoes and has the review history to show for it",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Sizing runs inconsistent across WHITIN models — read the size guidance for this specific model rather than assuming",
      "Thinner on cushioning than our #1, which is the point of the category but takes adjusting to",
    ],
    blurb:
      "If you want to try the category without committing to a direct-from-maker purchase, this is where we would start.",
  },
  {
    rank: 3,
    name: "WHITIN Men's Minimalist Trail Runner W30",
    brand: "WHITIN",
    score: 8.5,
    scoreLabel: "Excellent",
    grade: "B+",
    bestFor: "Best for Trails and Uneven Ground",
    verdict:
      "Built for ground that is not flat. If your walking is on trails rather than shop floors, this outgrips our #1 — but it is a men's fit and the tread is overkill indoors.",
    metrics: [
      { label: "Toe Box Width", value: 92 },
      { label: "All-Day Comfort", value: 82 },
      { label: "Weight", value: 89 },
      { label: "Value for Money", value: 90 },
      { label: "Buyer Protection", value: 80 },
    ],
    trustNote: "Amazon returns policy applies",
    price: "Check price",
    image: "/images/gf-whitin-w30.webp",
    url: AMZ("B07KN41PGH", "whitin30"),
    ctaLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    pros: [
      "Wide toe box with a proper trail outsole, so it holds on wet ground and loose surfaces",
      "Very light for a shoe with this much tread",
      "The model most often recommended by people already deep in the barefoot category",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Men's sizing only",
      "The aggressive tread is unnecessary — and noisier — if you are mostly indoors on hard floors",
