    url: AMZ("B0DSCF7995", "zureto"),
    ctaLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    pros: [
      "Genuine barefoot construction — thin sole, wide forefoot, no heel lift",
      "Copper grounding plug through the sole, which is the entire reason to choose this over the others",
    ],
    cons: [
      "The grounding claims are the reason to buy it and the evidence for health benefits from earthing is thin — we are ranking it on the shoe, not the theory",
      "Narrower toe box and less comfortable over long days than anything above it",
